<div class="frame" style="width: 380px; height: 1060px;">
  <div class="apphead" style="padding: 0 16px; gap: 10px;">
    <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.2px;">Advantage</span>
    <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
    <span style="display: block; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--ink-100);"></span>
  </div>
  <div style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; min-height: 0; background: var(--surface-muted);">
    <div class="rail" style="flex: 0 0 300px; background: var(--surface-card); gap: 16px;">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Match</span>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
            <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;">M. Ellison</span>
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--viz-good)" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-500); margin: 0 2px;">vs</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">R. Duval</span>
          </div>
          <span class="score">6&ndash;4 3&ndash;6 7&ndash;5</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 11h18"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro tabular" style="color: var(--ink-700);">Mar 14, 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16"></rect><path d="M3 12h18M12 4v16"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro" style="color: var(--ink-700);">Hard</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro tabular mono" style="color: var(--ink-700);">02:14:38</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-400)" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.5 17.5 3 6V3h3l11.5 11.5M13 19l6-6M16 16l4 4M19 21l2-2"></path></svg>
          <span class="micro tabular" style="color: var(--ink-700);">247 points &middot; 31 games</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface-subtle); padding: 11px 12px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-sm">Match data</span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 100%;"></span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 86%;"></span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 54%;"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cap">
    <h3>Rail 1 &mdash; As built</h3>
    <p>Today&rsquo;s rail, here as the control. Eyebrow, name pair with the verified check, 26px score, then four icon-led fact rows and the derived-data block pinned to the bottom.</p>
    <p class="trade">The icons carry no information the label doesn&rsquo;t, and the score is one string rather than a result you can read set by set.</p>
  </div>
</div>
